msgstr "ເກີດບັນຫາໃນການລັນສະຄຣິບຂອງແພັກເກດ."

#. TRANSLATORS: substituting: key ID, (key name), fingerprint
#: agama-software/src/callbacks/security.rs:104
msgid ""
"The key {0} ({1}) with fingerprint {2} is unknown. Do you want to trust this "
"key?"
msgstr "ຄີ {0} ({1}) ທີ່ມີ fingerprint {2} ແມ່ນບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ. ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການເຊື່ອຖືຄີນີ້ບໍ່?"

#: agama-software/src/callbacks/security.rs:111
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "ຂ້າມ"

#: agama-software/src/service.rs:296
msgid ""
"Due to an internal error, it was not possible to create a software proposal."
msgstr "ເນື່ອງຈາກເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດພາຍໃນ, ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງຂໍ້ສະເໜີຊອບແວໄດ້."

#: agama-software/src/zypp_server.rs:300
msgid "Starting packages installation"
msgstr "ກຳລັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ"

#: agama-software/src/zypp_server.rs:313
msgid "Packages download and installation failed. Would you like to retry?"
msgstr "ການດາວໂຫລດ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ. ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການລອງໃໝ່ບໍ່?"

#: agama-software/src/zypp_server.rs:368
msgid "Updating the list of repositories"
msgstr "ກຳລັງອັບເດດລາຍຊື່ຄັງຊອບແວ"

#: agama-software/src/zypp_server.rs:369
msgid "Refreshing metadata from the repositories"
msgstr "ກຳລັງຣີເຟຣຊຂໍ້ມູນ (metadata) ຈາກຄັງຊອບແວ"

#: agama-software/src/zypp_server.rs:370
msgid "Calculating the software proposal"
msgstr "ກຳລັງຄຳນວນຂໍ້ສະເໜີຊອບແວ"

#: agama-software/src/zypp_server.rs:373
msgid "Registering the system"
msgstr "ກຳລັງລົງທະບຽນລະບົບ"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the alias of the repository.
#: agama-software/src/zypp_server.rs:446
msgid "Could not remove the repository %s"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບຄັງຊອບແວ %s ອອກໄດ້"

#: agama-software/src/zypp_server.rs:466
msgid "Could not read the repositories"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດອ່ານຄັງຊອບແວໄດ້"

#: agama-software/src/zypp_server.rs:502
msgid ""
"Failed to find the product in the repositories. You might need to register "
"the system."
msgstr "ບໍ່ພົບຜະລິດຕະພັນໃນຄັງຊອບແວ. ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນລະບົບກ່ອນ."

#: agama-software/src/zypp_server.rs:505
msgid "Failed to find the product in the repositories."
msgstr "ບໍ່ພົບຜະລິດຕະພັນໃນຄັງຊອບແວ."

#: agama-software/src/zypp_server.rs:568
