msgstr "ມີຂໍ້ຂັດແຍ່ງໃນການເລືອກຊອບແວ"

#. TRANSLATORS: the first %s is the kind of resolvable (e.g., "package")
#. and the second %s is the name of the resolvable.
#: agama-software/src/zypp_server.rs:597
msgid "Could not select %s '%s' for installation"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດເລືອກ %s '%s' ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງໄດ້"

#: agama-software/src/zypp_server.rs:1010
